567
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:26,800
The claims for lost wages

568
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:29,000
and mental distress are not much at all.

569
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,520
Why sue over such a small matter?

570
00:23:31,520 --> 00:23:33,520
This might be Lawyer Xiao's strategy.

571
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:34,480
She is combative.

572
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,540
I know her too well.

573
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,080
Chao.

574
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:41,720
I suddenly feel

575
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:43,880
that your medical dispute is indeed quite troublesome.

576
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:45,010
How about we switch?

577
00:23:45,240 --> 00:23:48,570
