578
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:55,080
Eat up, it'll get cold soon.

579
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,480
I'll do it.

580
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:01,800
No.

581
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:04,760
Lawyer Li, how can we trouble you with such a small matter?

582
00:24:04,760 --> 00:24:05,820
Is it troublesome?

583
00:24:06,280 --> 00:24:08,940
It's very interesting. Not troublesome at all.

584
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,280
Bottoms up.

585
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:12,010
No need to drink,

586
00:24:12,080 --> 00:24:14,000
