587
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:14,760
I'll pay.

588
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:16,080
Then I'll drink too.

589
00:24:16,560 --> 00:24:17,280
Well,

590
00:24:17,520 --> 00:24:18,980
add another soy sauce crab

591
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,280
and bibimbap,

592
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:21,320
one for each of us.

593
00:24:21,320 --> 00:24:22,920
Two portions? Are you not full?

594
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,240
Aren't you treating us?

595
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:25,080
Two portions.

596
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:27,800
If we can't finish it, we can top up the card. Give us another menu.

597
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:28,760
Xu Jiayi's

598
00:24:28,760 --> 00:24:30,480
acute stress reaction

599
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:32,280
is related to a very important factor,

600
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:35,140
which we professionally call a state of isolation.

601
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:37,440
Information isolation and physical isolation

602
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:39,040
can easily make people feel

603
00:24:39,040 --> 00:24:41,040
oppressed and sad.

604
00:24:41,320 --> 00:24:42,880
Under these circumstances,

605
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,320
even a less severe traumatic event

606
00:24:45,320 --> 00:24:48,040
can cause serious mental harm.

607
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:49,880
Dr. Shen,

608
00:24:50,320 --> 00:24:52,200
let me see if I understand this correctly.

609
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:54,320
Because the incident happened in a

610
00:24:54,320 --> 00:24:56,000
closed cabin,

611
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:56,800
it

612
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,560
caused Xu Jiayi's

613
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:00,480
uncomfortable feelings to be magnified.

614
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:01,160
Exactly.

615
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:03,760
Plus, she was facing a male,

616
00:25:04,040 --> 00:25:06,640
and the other party had an absolute advantage

617
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:08,800
in physical conditions like size and strength.

618
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:11,720
So her psychological fear was inevitable.

619
00:25:13,080 --> 00:25:15,720
If she gets an apology from Hu Sheng,

620
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,200
will she recover sooner?

621
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,850
It will help to some extent.

622
00:25:21,080 --> 00:25:22,940
Understood. Thank you, Dr. Shen.

623
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:24,520
Could I trouble you

624
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:26,240
to give me a few different types of

625
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,480
psychological test papers?

626
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,000
Sure.

627
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:38,760
There are too many questions.

628
00:25:38,760 --> 00:25:39,320
I'm not doing this.

629
00:25:39,320 --> 00:25:40,520
I'm definitely fine.

630
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,080
Uncle.

631
00:25:42,080 --> 00:25:44,520
I'm taking a test here. Don't bother me.

632
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:46,720
Can you two stop bothering me?

633
00:25:46,760 --> 00:25:48,560
The higher the score, the more dangerous it is.

634
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,720
You two better be careful.

635
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,240
Come on. Do this one.

636
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:52,560
What is this?

637
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:58,000
That's ADHD, attention deficit.

638
00:25:58,040 --> 00:25:59,440
Then I definitely don't need to do it.

639
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:01,100
My attention is very focused.

640
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:06,610
You really don't need to take the test.

641
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:08,640
Look.

642
00:26:09,080 --> 00:26:10,320
Xu Jiayi is on

643
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:12,800
'Do you feel worthless

644
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:14,730
or think of yourself as a failure?'

645
00:26:14,800 --> 00:26:16,760
And have you ever had

646
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:18,880
the wish that it would be better to die?

647
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:20,200
For these two questions,

648
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:22,160
she checked 'strongly agree'.

649
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,480
Does this mean

650
00:26:24,520 --> 00:26:25,440
Jiayi's condition

651
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:27,080
