652
00:26:27,080 --> 00:26:27,800
Serious?

653
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,080
Isn't this just a questionnaire?

654
00:26:29,080 --> 00:26:30,320
If I chose 'strongly agree' for all of them,

655
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:31,080
would I be sick too?

656
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,000
You are sick.

657
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:33,440
And very sick, bro.

658
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:35,720
Does Jiayi need to lie?

659
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:37,200
She's telling the truth.

660
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:39,040
I didn't say she was lying.

661
00:26:39,200 --> 00:26:41,480
I'm just saying this thing is too subjective.

662
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,480
Can this be used as evidence?

663
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:44,000
Dong Beihu is right.

664
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:46,200
These diagnoses now

665
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,720
