666
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:50,800
The current law regarding physical injury

667
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:53,480
has a very clear standard for injury assessment.

668
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:54,760
But for psychological injury,

669
00:26:54,760 --> 00:26:57,320
