676
00:27:12,560 --> 00:27:13,880
Of course we should sue.

677
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,760
But suing doesn't mean going to court.

678
00:27:15,760 --> 00:27:17,420
It's a negotiation strategy.

679
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:25,040
Hello, Lawyer Li, what's up?

680
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:29,720
