681
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:31,080
You were waiting for my call, weren't you?

682
00:27:31,080 --> 00:27:32,080
That's not right.

683
00:27:33,800 --> 00:27:34,400
Shouldn't

684
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:35,480
that busybody Su

685
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,880
be in charge of this case?

686
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:39,320
He handed it over to me. Is there a problem?

687
00:27:39,320 --> 00:27:40,040
No problem.

688
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:42,640
Our demand is very simple.

689
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:45,040
As long as he apologizes, we'll drop the lawsuit.

690
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,040
Didn't you sue just to

691
00:27:46,040 --> 00:27:48,200
