692
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:49,400
Your goal has been achieved.

693
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:52,400
The airline is taking this matter very seriously now.

694
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:55,400
I'll go talk to Hu Sheng

695
00:27:55,520 --> 00:27:57,440
and meet the settlement conditions as soon as possible

696
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:58,800
