697
00:27:58,800 --> 00:27:59,640
That's great.

698
00:28:00,200 --> 00:28:02,260
Thanks for your hard work, Lawyer Li.

699
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:06,340
It's that suitcase again, right?

700
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:08,760
What? What suitcase?

701
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:10,650
He's so full of himself.

702
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:15,080
Jiayi has been in a really bad state lately.

703
00:28:15,080 --> 00:28:17,280
Okay, I'll solve it as soon as possible.

704
00:28:17,320 --> 00:28:18,560
Sorry to trouble you, Lawyer Li.

705
00:28:18,560 --> 00:28:19,080
Thank you so much.

706
00:28:19,080 --> 00:28:19,560
It's my job.

707
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:20,520
Hello, Lawyer Li.

708
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:21,760
I'm Lin Wenshu, an HR executive.

709
00:28:21,760 --> 00:28:22,800
Nice to meet you.

710
00:28:22,800 --> 00:28:24,080
