712
00:28:25,080 --> 00:28:26,340
Please don't mind him.

713
00:28:27,040 --> 00:28:29,080
It's fine. Solving the problem is the priority.

714
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:29,480
Right.

715
00:28:29,480 --> 00:28:30,520
Come, please have a seat.

716
00:28:30,520 --> 00:28:31,520
This way, please.

717
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:35,530
Thanks for your help today, Lawyer Li.

718
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,760
Hello, hello.

719
00:28:39,760 --> 00:28:40,760
Um, this is Hu,

720
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:42,000
Mr. Hu.

721
00:28:42,080 --> 00:28:42,880
Mr. Hu.

722
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:46,760
He's very busy. Please excuse him.

723
00:28:46,760 --> 00:28:47,760
It's fine.

724
00:28:48,760 --> 00:28:50,720
Mr. Hu, here's the thing.

725
00:28:50,720 --> 00:28:52,320
We've discussed it,

726
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:53,640
