730
00:29:00,040 --> 00:29:02,000
The only thing we ask is that you

731
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:04,530
apologize to our flight attendant, Xu Jiayi.

732
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,000
What do you think?

733
00:29:08,760 --> 00:29:09,560
Wait a minute.

734
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:11,880
Mr. Hu, the airline...

735
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:14,080
I'm in a meeting. I'll talk to you later.

736
00:29:15,320 --> 00:29:16,080
Go on.

737
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:19,040
Well, the airline

738
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:19,760
highly values

739
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:22,000
your feedback and evaluation of our service,

740
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:24,320
and we hope to continue serving you in the future.

741
00:29:24,320 --> 00:29:27,450
Actually, this whole thing is just a misunderstanding.

742
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:29,080
It's fine once we talk it out.

743
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,200
You guys handled this matter

744
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:37,320
