745
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:40,480
But your attitude today is acceptable.

746
00:29:41,040 --> 00:29:43,300
How about this? I can give her some money.

747
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,560
Apologizing is out of the question.

748
00:29:44,560 --> 00:29:46,480
It's good enough that I didn't cause her trouble.

749
00:29:46,480 --> 00:29:47,080
All right.

750
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:51,480
But actually, Xu Jiayi was also frightened.

751
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:52,800
Please be magnanimous.

752
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:53,760
We can talk this over.

753
00:29:53,760 --> 00:29:55,040
