756
00:29:59,800 --> 00:30:01,200
That's not what I meant.

757
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:09,040
Look, let me reiterate.

758
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,720
I can give her some money.

759
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:12,200
But apologizing is out of the question.

760
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:13,040
That's settled.

761
00:30:13,040 --> 00:30:14,440
Mr. Hu.

762
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,770
Mr. Hu, you have to accept the settlement.

763
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:21,800
What do you mean by that?

764
00:30:21,800 --> 00:30:22,720
Three things.

765
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,100
Please have a seat.

766
00:30:24,320 --> 00:30:25,480
Mr. Hu, I'm sorry.

767
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,560
I forgot to introduce him.

768
00:30:26,560 --> 00:30:29,620
This is Li Xin, the attorney representing our airline.

769
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:31,800
He is a top lawyer from Honghu.

770
00:30:33,560 --> 00:30:34,890
Let's sit down and talk.

771
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:40,720
Three things.

772
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,200
First,

773
00:30:44,640 --> 00:30:45,520
Xu Jiayi's current

774
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:47,480
psychological evaluation is not good.

775
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:49,080
If it's not resolved in time,

776
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:50,860
things could get worse later.

777
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:51,480
Second,

778
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:53,200
the cameras on the plane were on the whole time.

779
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:55,080
If we continue with legal proceedings,

780
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:57,280
these will be submitted as evidence,

781
00:30:57,800 --> 00:31:00,160
which will cause unnecessary public scrutiny.

782
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:00,560
Third,

783
00:31:01,040 --> 00:31:03,080
although your behavior does not constitute a criminal offense,

784
00:31:03,080 --> 00:31:06,200
it's hard to clear you of civil tort liability.

785
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:07,760
Based on the current evidence,

786
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:09,480
