793
00:31:22,400 --> 00:31:23,080
Thank you.

794
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:33,880
Oh my god.

795
00:31:33,880 --> 00:31:35,440
I really, really don't want to waste time

796
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:36,520
