797
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:40,000
I see. As long as she drops the lawsuit,

798
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:42,360
I can be the bigger person and apologize to her.

799
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:43,420
Are you satisfied?

800
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,320
Thank you.

801
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:45,280
Thank you.

802
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:48,200
I'm done with my meeting. I'll head over to you.

803
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,400
See you.

804
00:31:50,040 --> 00:31:51,320
Make the VIP status happen as soon as possible.

805
00:31:51,320 --> 00:31:52,080
No problem.

806
00:31:53,600 --> 00:31:54,840
Hello, Lawyer Xiao.

807
00:31:55,160 --> 00:31:56,620
Hu Sheng agreed to settle.

808
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:57,840
Come to Honghu.

809
00:31:57,840 --> 00:32:00,360
Let's discuss the specific settlement process.

810
00:32:00,360 --> 00:32:02,400
If he agreed to settle, shouldn't you come to me?

811
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,800
Why should I go to Honghu?

812
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,210
Your place is too small.

813
00:32:06,040 --> 00:32:07,320
How old are you?

814
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,640
Is this place not big enough for you?

815
00:32:09,760 --> 00:32:11,880
You're not afraid to come, are you?

816
00:32:12,320 --> 00:32:13,560
Li Xin, you don't need to goad me.

817
00:32:13,560 --> 00:32:14,520
It won't work.

818
00:32:14,520 --> 00:32:15,640
What's there to be afraid of?

819
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:16,840
You wait right there.

820
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:19,000
Okay, I'll wait right here for you.

821
00:32:21,600 --> 00:32:22,280
What's wrong, sis?

822
00:32:22,280 --> 00:32:23,040
Who are we taking on?

823
00:32:23,040 --> 00:32:23,880
What do you mean, taking on?

824
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:26,400
