825
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,600
That's ridiculous.

826
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:29,400
Look how arrogant he is.

827
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:31,040
Showing off like this after winning just once.

828
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:32,680
You must go and take him down a peg.

829
00:32:32,680 --> 00:32:33,920
Sis, I'll go with you.

830
00:32:34,360 --> 00:32:35,680
Director, can I go?

831
00:32:35,840 --> 00:32:37,370
I can take meeting minutes.

832
00:32:37,560 --> 00:32:39,040
Yes, why not?

833
00:32:39,360 --> 00:32:41,320
Pack up. Let's go together.

834
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:42,040
Okay.

835
00:32:54,800 --> 00:32:56,000
The car is in the back.

836
00:33:08,600 --> 00:33:09,460
-Feng A·D85NB-

837
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:43,920
Can you show some promise?

838
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,120
Chest out, head high.

